cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite both the software itself
  and the accompanying paper.
type: software
title: >-
  pinn-reef-thermal: Physics-Informed Neural Networks for
  Depth-Resolved Coral Reef Thermal Reconstruction
abstract: >-
  Open-source Python package implementing a physics-informed
  neural network framework for reconstructing depth-resolved
  thermal fields on coral reefs from satellite sea surface
  temperature and sparse in-situ logger observations. The
  framework embeds the one-dimensional vertical heat equation
  with depth-attenuated solar heating as a soft constraint,
  enforces satellite SST as a hard surface boundary condition,
  and jointly learns effective thermal diffusivity and light
  attenuation from data.
